/S /H1
/T (        The global recycling industry is under pressure due to the legislation made in China. As a result, several countries are facing a waste management crisis, with landfills overflowing and the problem worsening each day. Many landfills are reaching full capacity and it is fast becoming an impending crisis. From an environmental perspective, burning these plastic wastes in cement plants, incinerators, and thermal power plants does not provide a solution. A more environmentally optimal, new strategy is needed to address this urgent problem. [8] )
/E (        The global recycling industry is under pressure due to the legislation made in China. As a result, several countries are facing a waste management crisis, with landfills overflowing and the problem worsening each day. Many landfills are reaching full capacity and it is fast becoming an impending crisis. From an environmental perspective, burning these plastic wastes in cement plants, incinerators, and thermal power plants does not provide a solution. A more environmentally optimal, new strategy is needed to address this urgent problem. [8] )
