/E (    The IGNA token is a next-generation cryptocurrency based on the Solana network, designed for use in the world of decentralized financial services \(DeFi\) and smart contracts. The Solana blockchain offers excellent transaction speed and scalability, providing an ideal foundation for ambitious projects like the IGNA token. The scalability of a token means it can handle higher loads or a larger number of users without a significant decrease in performance.)
